# Generated FEC exports — real output from local dev/testing, not fixtures
# to check in. Real reference FEC samples belong in samples/ but should be
# added deliberately (git add -f), not swept in by accident.
samples/*.txt

# A real, filled Monaco DSF declaration (name/address/dossier number of an
# actual filer) used as a structural reference for the Monaco VAT pass —
# never commit it. specs/vat-monaco-implementation-spec.md documents the
# line structure and labels only, no filer data.
specs/Blank VAT form MONACO.pdf

# Desktop packaging prototype — runtime data generated by the Postgres
# bundling prototype (initdb cluster, logs, backup dumps, the generated
# local-only DB credentials file). The scripts are source-controlled;
# anything they produce at runtime is not.
desktop/postgres-prototype/pgdata/
desktop/postgres-prototype/logs/
desktop/postgres-prototype/backups/
desktop/postgres-prototype/scratch-restore/
desktop/postgres-prototype/local-db-config.json
desktop/node-sidecar-prototype/staging/
desktop/node-sidecar-prototype/sidecar-stdout.log
desktop/node-sidecar-prototype/sidecar-stderr.log
desktop/node-sidecar-prototype/sidecar.pid

# Tauri build output and staged sidecar resources — produced by the CI
